    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iitooda madeeda bea fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Musa aba dareapcheeda Sinayi, aba jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, eaweeda madeeda bea sheedeaba iyeenya, aba gweaydeaba iyeenya iing'ata rinooda rinna ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ayiita buuneesean bwat geat bea Israeli, giliwas sih ea fugeaba gheanyi, ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, ng'oara gheawunga headiga sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada siida bea gweanyeew diktam, ghana ghwanaawa, was fuga ammu gaweay ng'ucheeda aba jeeda Israeli, gajayiita ang'iing'i ea Haruni aba gidabeada geenga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajandeawana siyagi bea gilatoash; was siida haw aba gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheawunga fuga jea andeawana ea suh; Dea dooshta Rubeni; Elisuri orjeeda Shedeuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Simeoni; Shelumieli orjeeda Suri-shadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Yuda; Nashoni orjeeda Aminadaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Isakari; Netaneli orjeeda Suari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Sabuloni; Eliyabu orjeeda Heloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda orjooga Yosefu; bea dooshta Efraimu; Elishama gil orjeeda Amihudi; nea dea dooshta Manase; ea Gamalieli orjeeda Bedasuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Benjamini; Abidani orjeeda Gideoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Dani; Ahieseri orjeeda Amishadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Asheri; Bagieli orjeeda Okirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Gadi; Eliyasafu orjeeda Deueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea dooshta Naftali; Ahira gil orjeeda Enani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga siloat gil aba jeeda eemeeda Israeliin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda Musa ea Haruni headigiga sirugu gheawunga nyaawaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gageanu saawa eaweeda madeeda bea sheedeaba iyeenya, ak ghabwada geat eemeesean ghayi siyiida was gilasih ea gheanyi ea dooshta nyaawa. Gawuurji gidabeada gheawunga fuga bea gweanyeew diktam ea gea naawa, nea geanung' gabadiina agi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ak ghoah gidiitiida aba hoowa bea dareapcheeda Sinayiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Rubeni, was duweacheeda Israeli, jeacheenga nyaawa, aba gidabeada diibiga nyaawa, ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa ea mooneeda gheawunga nyaawa, aba giliwas sih, giliwas sih bea gweanyeew diktam ea gea naawa, was buuneesean ammu, gaweay ng'ucheeda: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mooneeda fuga dooshta Rubeni ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea lah ea bughalaji muut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
