            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda orjooga Yuda, jeacheenga nyaawa, aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa, ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, aba mooneeda gheawunga nyaawa, ghang'eada siida bea gweanyeew diktam ea gea naawa, fuga sean ammu ng'ucheeda; ",
