        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda fuga Isakari, jeacheenga nyaawa, aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa, ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, aba giteena mooneeda gheawunga, ghang'eada siida bea gweanyeew diktam ea ghwanaawa, was buuneesean ammu gaweay ng'ucheeda: ",
