              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga ghayi iida Musa ea Haruni gil sea fuga hees atamaniyeenya bea Israeli weat saawa aba iitooda; nea gaba siisi weat aba meatkweeda fuga gealga ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
