          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gidabeada ghayi gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eemeeni bea Lawiin adiidu giyiidayi, nea mooneeda nyaawa ea adiiguuyeewi sea dea fuga Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak giloadi fuga Lawi ghoah fuga jea gafur maheemajeanda muuwuunooda, ea dabitaanyi sean ea haleanjeadaanyi sean, saawa gaygagadiyeesa, ak gwajip maheemajeega nyaawa nea gooneaweesa maheemajeanda meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iissa iijea gawa maheemajeanda mwadi, nea iijea eengoor maheemajeanda, iissa gayghwahiing'u fuga Lawi, nea rabascheanda jea gwaneekiisa gajeabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwajip fuga Israeli maheemajeega nyaawa, ak gaba siisi abiida jeeda museasoadaanyi, ak gaba siisi miinaada aba guumda beendeerajeandaanyi, gawuurji gidabeada lugweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Lawi gaygwajip maheemajeega nyaawa nea ghwanung' gwaneaweesa maheemajeanda muuwuunooda aba meadajeega sean, ak ea mwahina nyarasta badahuuka fuga Israeli; ak gaygafur fuga Lawi maheemajeanda muuwuunooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
